      "content": "Thanks for the heads up on the legacy stuff. Regarding the scanning tools themselves though—our primary suite for the network and endpoint monitoring—are you seeing any issues with their reliability or sensor integrity? Just want to be 100% sure the data we're feeding the auditors is actually accurate and hasn't been compromised or missed anything due to tool-side bugs.",
